# Docs files load docs playbooks

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

When these files are in play, load Autodevelop handbook playbooks. Use what comes back. Do not invent that text. Do not name a third-party skill as the tool.

Never say bucket, MCP, or tool names in chat.

If playbooks do not load, say only: Autodevelop is not connected. Run `npx autodevelop login` and reload this window. Then stop.

Must never: instance bindings or secrets in the handbook, GitHub Actions in this plugin repo.

Do not publish a public docs host without a confirmed Access challenge. See [docs-access-before-publish](../process/docs-access-before-publish.mdc).

Product work still needs a bound ticket. See [ticket-required](../process/ticket-required.mdc). Wrapper rules: [mcp-wrappers](../process/mcp-wrappers.mdc).
